# Pipeline working files are regenerable from run_generation.sh and are not tracked.
candidates/*
candidates/**/*.log
candidates/**/~$*

# ...but the DELIVERABLES are. These are what the review is actually about, so they belong in the
# open repo rather than being regenerated privately: the 31-row candidate set, the review queue the
# mentors filled in, their recorded verdicts, and the design decisions the set exists to settle.
!candidates/iced.json
!candidates/review/
candidates/review/*.xlsx
